From 35f27094c33e7d5616becd42512df337748a2056 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: horizon-prism <horizon-prism@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:15:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Horizon instance settings page (M2)

- HorizonSettingsPage edits the horizon.json model: channel, pinned client
  and preparer versions, and fullscreen;
- it shows the launch contract (Minecraft, launch_api, output_version,
  native_hooks_api) and the resources state read-only;
- the page is only added for Horizon instances, next to the generic Prism
  settings page;
- HorizonInstance gains fullscreen()/setFullscreen()/installedVersions();
- HorizonLaunchStep passes --fullscreen instead of --width/--height when
  the option is enabled.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
